react
react is js library used to build single page application
react features:
1. virtual dom- it is copy of real dom
              - it will compare and render the changes only
                using diffing algorithm and entire process is called reconcialation
2.component architecture-navbar,footer,card,sidebar.jsx
3.single page application-it contains only one index.html
 
